* `QYM.TruncationGapStabilityCore` proves quantitative matched-eigenvalue and fixed-gap transfer,
  including eventual half-gap estimates, and separates pointwise from uniform-in-index convergence
  by an explicit moving-index spike.
* `QYM.RootExpWeylLogicCore` distinguishes eventual from all-index root-exponential estimates and
  parameterwise from uniform Weyl constants, with explicit finite-prefix suppliers and no-go
  sequences.
* `QYM.ComplexRootExponentialExtension` states the coefficient estimates on `ℕ → ℂ`, constructs an
