/-!
# Typed evidence for the remaining twenty-three claim rows

This independent registry supplies typed proof objects for exactly the twenty-three `ClaimId`
rows that receive no link from the three earlier typed-evidence registries.  Each identifier below
is assigned one exact proposition, and `evidenceSound` proves precisely that proposition.

The links are non-terminal audit links.  In particular, evidence for an external or
`blockedExternal` row consists of a supplier-conditional implication, a refuted overstrong
inference, or a concrete logical countermodel.  Such evidence does **not** prove the original
Paper-I, Rademacher, Sobolev, trace, Weyl, compactness, or gauge-slice supplier and does not promote
the corresponding PDF row to an unconditional theorem.  The Corollary-4.28 uniform-window
transfer included with the Proposition-4.27 evidence is only a conditional companion once a
uniform Weyl estimate and an indicator majorant have been supplied.

There is deliberately no terminal-status or self-certifying conclusion field in this namespace.
`Certificate.proof` is dependent on its identifier.  The canonical certificate below is constructed
from `evidenceSound`; any other construction must independently supply a proof of the same exact
`EvidenceStatement`.
-/

namespace QYM.FullCertification.TypedEvidenceFullClaimExtension

open QYM.FullCertification.Registry

/-! ## Stable typed identifiers -/

/-- One identifier for each previously unlinked claim row, in paper source order. -/
inductive EvidenceId where
  | prop2_2Locality
  | axiomA3MMassCoercivityNoGo
  | axiomA3VAbsorptionNoGo
  | axiomA3RTailUniformityNoGo
  | axiomA3TScalarInvarianceNoGo
  | lemma3_3InvariantEnergy
  | def3_1AdmissibleSubtype
  | assumption3_5ActionDefinedness
  | assumption3_6CoercivitySuppliers
  | assumption3_8CuspTrace
  | def4_1AdmissibleVariation
  | axiom4_4CuspIBP
  | cor4_7StructuralSkew
  | assumption4_8SobolevBilinear
  | lemma4_13ClosedGraphAndForm
  | lemma4_16DensityAndProjectedClosedness
  | hyp4_20MassCoercivityNoGo
  | hyp4_22FormDomination
  | hyp4_24TruncationUniformityNoGo
  | theorem4_26RootExponential
  | prop4_27WeylUniformityNoGo
  | hypA_4MassCoercivityNoGo
  | hypA_6FormDominationNoGo
  deriving DecidableEq, Repr

